    {"service_key":"death-certificate","service_name":"Death Certificate","state":"Bihar","jurisdiction_type":"state","category":"Certificates","icon":"\U0001f4c4","department":"Department of Planning and Development, Government of Bihar","portal_name":"CRS Portal (Civil Registration System)","portal_url":"https://dc.crsorgi.gov.in","apply_url":"https://dc.crsorgi.gov.in/crs/ReportEvent/ReportDeath","documents_json":"[\"Hospital discharge summary / death intimation (if hospital death) \u2014 contains details needed for registration\",\"Aadhaar card of deceased and informant (if available \u2014 not mandatory but recommended for identity matching)\",\"Medical Certificate of Cause of Death \u2014 Form 4 (for hospital in-patient deaths, filled by attending doctor) or Form 4A (for non-institutional/home deaths, filled by treating physician)\",\"Mobile number and/or email of informant (for SMS/tracking)\",\"For delayed registration (21 days\u20131 year): self-attested affidavit explaining the delay\",\"For registration after 1 year: notarized affidavit + supporting proof + District Magistrate/court order\"]","eligibility":"Every death occurring in Bihar must be registered; Head of household/nearest relative (for home deaths) or medical officer in-charge (for hospital deaths) is responsible for reporting","fees":"Free if registered within 21 days of death. Delayed registration (21 days\u20131 year): nominal fee applies. After 1 year: notarized affidavit + court/magistrate order required, fee applies","timeline":"Same-day to a few days if reported within 21 days by hospital/family. Delayed registration: 30\u201360+ days depending on how late","photo_size":"Not applicable","signature_size":"Not applicable","upload_limits":"Not specified for standard registration","validity":"Lifetime \u2014 no renewal needed","application_steps_json":"[\"If death just occurred: Report to the local Registrar within 21 days \u2014 hospital reports automatically for institutional deaths; for home deaths, the head of household/nearest relative must report (Anganwadi worker/ASHA/ANM can also assist)\",\"To register online: Go to dc.crsorgi.gov.in \u2192 Death Registration\",\"Fill Legal Information (Step 1): state/UT of death, general info, deceased's details (name, DOB, date/time/place of death, sex, Aadhaar), mother's/father's/spouse's details, address at time of death, permanent address, place of death\",\"Proceed to Statistical Information (Step 2): informant details, religion, occupation, medical attention type, cause of death, habits (smoking/tobacco/alcohol) if applicable\",\"Confirm Legal Information (Step 3) and Statistical Information (Step 4) \u2014 review before final submit\",\"Attach Medical Certificate of Cause of Death (Form 4/4A) if hospital-certified\",\"Submit \u2014 registration number generated, certificate delivered digitally\",\"To download an already-registered certificate: dc.crsorgi.gov.in \u2192 Download Certificate \u2192 Bihar \u2192 Death \u2192 enter Registration Number, district, date of death\",\"For old physical certificates (pre-digital): apply for digitization via the Central CRS Portal; Registrar verifies against physical register and forwards to District Registrar for e-Signature approval before issuing digital copy\",\"If delayed (21 days\u20131 year): Visit local Registrar with self-attested affidavit explaining delay\",\"If more than 1 year late: Notarized affidavit + supporting documents + Magistrate/court order required\",\"If aggrieved by a Registrar's action/order, appeal to District Registrar within 30 days (further appeal to Chief Registrar if needed); appeals must be decided within 90 days\"]","notes":"Free if registered within 21 days of death \u2014 try hard to hit this \nwindow. Since October 2023, a death certificate is legally mandatory \nfor property transfer to legal heirs, insurance/bank claims, family \npension, and removing the deceased's name from voter rolls or pension \nschemes \u2014 you cannot skip this step. One free copy goes to the \ninformant; extra copies cost a small fee. For hospital deaths, get the \nMedical Certificate of Cause of Death (Form 4) from the hospital before \nleaving \u2014 you'll need it. For home deaths, a local doctor issues Form \n4A instead. Missed the 21-day window? You'll need an affidavit, and it \ntakes noticeably longer. Keep your login credentials on the CRS portal \nprivate \u2014 never share your OTP or password, even with someone claiming \nto help you register, as fake certificate fraud using stolen credentials \nhas been a real, recently flagged problem (June 2026).","sources_json":"[\"https://dc.crsorgi.gov.in\",\"https://crsorgi.gov.in\",\"https://dc.crsorgi.gov.in/crs/ReportEvent/ReportDeath\"]","confidence_score":100,"last_verified":"2026-07-14","manual_review_needed":0,"has_variants":0,"active":1,"version":5,"updated_by":"shivraj"},
    {"service_key":"marriage-certificate","service_name":"Marriage Certificate","state":"Bihar","jurisdiction_type":"state","category":"Certificates","icon":"\U0001f48d","department":"Prohibition, Excise and Registration Department (Registration Wing)","portal_name":"e-Nibandhan Portal","portal_url":"https://nibandhan.bihar.gov.in","apply_url":"https://nibandhan.bihar.gov.in/Marriage/OnlineLoginMarriage.aspx","documents_json":"[\"Joint photograph of bride and groom\",\"Age proof of both bride and groom (Matriculation certificate/Birth certificate)\",\"Address proof of applicant (Aadhaar/Voter ID/Ration card)\",\"Marriage invitation card (if available)\",\"Signature of bride and groom\",\"Signature of one witness from bride's side\",\"Signature of one witness from bridegroom's side\",\"Aadhaar card of both parties\"]","eligibility":"Groom min. age 21, bride min. age 18; both consenting, not already married to a living spouse; applicant (husband or wife) must reside in the registrar's jurisdiction","fees":"\u20b9100 (approx, varies slightly by registrar office \u2014 confirm at time of payment)","timeline":"30 working days","photo_size":"Not applicable","signature_size":"Not applicable","upload_limits":"Not mentioned","validity":"Lifetime","application_steps_json":"[\"Visit e-Nibandhan portal and select Marriage Registration\",\"Fill Form A-1 with bridegroom and bride particulars (name, age, parents' names, marital status, address)\",\"Enter solemnization details \u2014 date and place of marriage\",\"Upload required documents and joint photograph\",\"Submit application \u2014 Application No. generated (linked to Panchayat/Block/District)\",\"Authorities invite objections from the public for 30 days\",\"If no objection, marriage is entered in the Marriage Registration Register (Form B-2) and Certificate (Form C) is issued\",\"If an objection arises, case is referred to the Marriage Deputy Registrar General for a decision\"]","notes":"Governed by the Bihar Marriage Registration Rules, 2006. Distinct from RTPS/General Administration Dept \u2014 handled entirely by Registration Dept via e-Nibandhan, separate login system. Forms used: A-1/A-2/A-3 (application, 3 copies for applicant/registrar/deputy registrar general), B-1 (register of ward members), B-2 (marriage registration register), Form C (final certificate). Registrar is typically the local Sub-Registrar. Some sources mention marriages can also register under Hindu Marriage Act 1955 or Special Marriage Act 1954 \u2014 this entry covers registration under the Bihar Marriage Registration Rules, 2006 (the state civil registration route), not the Special Marriage Act court-marriage route, which is a separate legal process with a different notice procedure.","sources_json":"[\"https://nibandhan.bihar.gov.in\",\"https://nibandhan.bihar.gov.in/Marriage/OnlineLoginMarriage.aspx\",\"https://nibandhan.bihar.gov.in/Society/Online/mact.pdf\"]","confidence_score":100,"last_verified":"2026-07-14","manual_review_needed":0,"has_variants":0,"active":1,"version":4,"updated_by":"shivraj"},
    {"service_key":"character-certificate","service_name":"Character Certificate","state":"Bihar","jurisdiction_type":"state","category":"Certificates","icon":"\U0001f4c4","department":"Home Department (Police)","portal_name":"RTPS Bihar / ServicePlus","portal_url":"https://serviceonline.bihar.gov.in","apply_url":"https://serviceonline.bihar.gov.in/renderApplicationForm.do?serviceId=12050016&UUID=b506a600-f093-44e6-8df4-05ca76e443b0&directService=true&tempId=4236&grievDefined=0&serviceLinkRequired=No&userLoggedIn=N&source=CTZN&OWASP_CSRFTOKEN=1NCK-XVQS-JF7L-9U7H-RGCR-QI6V-O3IL-1PRE","documents_json":"[\"Aadhaar Card\",\"Self-attested photograph of applicant (max 300KB)\",\"Active Mobile number (mandatory \u2014 for SMS delivery)\",\"Email ID (mandatory \u2014 for certificate delivery as email attachment)\",\"Proof/details of domicile for the last 2 years (addresses, from-to dates \u2014 filled directly into the form, no separate document upload, but have this history ready)\"]","eligibility":"Any Bihar resident needing character verification for a specific stated purpose","fees":"Free (No application fee)","timeline":"10\u201320 working days","photo_size":"Max 300KB","signature_size":"Not required","upload_limits":"JPG , max 300KB","validity":"6 months from date of issue","application_steps_json":"[\"Go to serviceonline.bihar.gov.in \u2192 \\\"Apply for Character Certificate\\\"\",\"Select certificate format language (Hindi/English)\",\"Fill gender, salutation, applicant name, father's/mother's/husband's name\",\"Enter mobile number and email (both mandatory)\",\"Fill Permanent Address in full (state, district, sub-division, block, village/town, post office, ward, PIN, local body type)\",\"Fill Present Address \u2014 tick \\\"Same as Above\\\" if identical, or fill separately including Police Station\",\"Upload self-attested photo (under 300KB) and select Profession\",\"Select Purpose of Application from the checklist \u2014 choose the specific reason: passport, arms license, various government licenses (petrol pump, gas agency etc.), government bid/contract work, bank/institution loan intimation, permanent/contract government service, government assistance/NGO consideration, or any other purpose requiring police verification\",\"Fill Domicile Details of last 2 years \u2014 type of residence, district, police station, address, and exact from-month/year to to-month/year (can add multiple rows if you moved)\",\"Complete self-declaration and tick \\\"I Agree\\\"\",\"Review the \\\"Apply to the Office\\\" field \u2014 this auto-fills to your district's SP office based on your address\",\"Enter captcha, click Submit | Preview your application, then click Submit again to finalize\",\"Save the Acknowledgement/Application Reference Number shown\",\"Track status (Track Application Status) using the Reference Number\"]","notes":"Valid for only 6 months from issue date \u2014 shortest validity of any RTPS \ncertificate, so apply close to when you'll actually need it. Photo must \nbe under 300KB. This certificate is issued by Police (Superintendent of \nPolice office), not the General Administration Department like Caste/\nIncome/Residence \u2014 so processing involves actual police verification of \nyour address and background, not just document review. You must select \na specific Purpose (passport, license, government job, contract work, \netc.) \u2014 it's issued for that stated use, not as a general-purpose \ndocument. Be ready with your exact residential history for the last 2 \nyears, including dates.","sources_json":"[\"https://serviceonline.bihar.gov.in\",\"https://serviceonline.bihar.gov.in/renderApplicationForm.do?serviceId=12050016&UUID=b506a600-f093-44e6-8df4-05ca76e443b0&directService=true&tempId=4236&grievDefined=0&serviceLinkRequired=No&userLoggedIn=N&source=CTZN&OWASP_CSRFTOKEN=1NCK-XVQS-JF7L-9U7H-RGCR-QI6V-O3IL-1PRE\"]","confidence_score":100,"last_verified":"2026-07-14","manual_review_needed":0,"has_variants":0,"active":1,"version":6,"updated_by":"shivraj"},
    {"service_key":"ews-certificate","service_name":"EWS Certificate","state":"Bihar","jurisdiction_type":"state","category":"Certificates","icon":"\U0001f4c4","department":"General Administration Department (GAD)","portal_name":"RTPS Bihar / ServicePlus","portal_url":"https://serviceonline.bihar.gov.in","apply_url":"https://serviceonline.bihar.gov.in/renderApplicationForm.do?serviceId=10430013&UUID=fe547d9d-c36c-4fec-8279-c262031c62b9&directService=true&tempId=3498&grievDefined=0&serviceLinkRequired=No&userLoggedIn=N&source=CTZN&OWASP_CSRFTOKEN=SDI3-F0QL-JTG0-IVBU-CWVI-7UY4-IWJJ-1AGW","documents_json":"[\"Aadhaar Card\",\"Block-Level Residence Certificate (Mandatory)\",\"Self-declaration of family income\",\"An active Mobile number (mandatory \u2014 for SMS delivery)\",\"Email ID (mandatory)\",\"Self-attested photograph of applicant or authorized representative\",\"Proof you don't hold SC/ST/OBC/EBC status (declared via self-declaration, no separate document)\"]","eligibility":"General Category only; family annual income below \u20b98 lakh; family doesn't own 5+ acres agricultural land, 1000+ sq.ft residential flat, 100+ sq.yard residential plot (in notified municipality) or 200+ sq.yard (elsewhere)","fees":"Free (No application fee)","timeline":"10\u201315 working days (same RTPS pattern as Income/Caste)","photo_size":"JPG, max ~200KB","signature_size":"Not required","upload_limits":"JPG, max ~200KB","validity":"1 year from date of issue","application_steps_json":"[\"First obtain a Block-Level Residence Certificate if you don't already have one \u2014 this is mandatory before applying\",\"Go to serviceonline.bihar.gov.in\",\"Online Application \u2192 RTPS Services \u2192 General Administration Department \u2192 \\\"Issuance of Economically Weaker Section Certificate\\\"\",\"Choose level: Block/Circle (CO), Sub-Division (SDO), or District (DM) \u2014 DM level required for Central Government EWS jobs and IIT/NIT admissions\",\"Select certificate language format (Hindi/English)\",\"Fill gender, salutation, name, father's/mother's/husband's name, Aadhaar, DOB\",\"Fill residential address: district, sub-division, block, local body type, ward, village, post office, police station, holding number, circle number\",\"Choose declaration (a) or (b) regarding Central/State OBC list status\",\"Select your caste from dropdown\",\"Enter mobile number and email | Upload self-attested photo, enter total family annual income\",\"Complete self-declaration covering income sources, land/property holdings, and tick \\\"I Agree\\\"\",\"Choose the office, enter captcha, and submit\"]","notes":"Valid for 1 year from issue date \u2014 matches a specific financial year, \nso reapply each year if still needed. You must already hold a \nBlock-Level Residence Certificate before applying \u2014 get that first if \nyou don't have it. Only for General Category; not for anyone already \nusing SC/ST/OBC/EBC reservation. Free to apply. Use DM-level \ncertificate for Central Government jobs or IIT/NIT admission \u2014 \nBlock/Circle level is rejected for these. Both mobile number and email \nare mandatory here.","sources_json":"[\"https://serviceonline.bihar.gov.in\",\"https://serviceonline.bihar.gov.in/renderApplicationForm.do?serviceId=10430013&UUID=fe547d9d-c36c-4fec-8279-c262031c62b9&directService=true&tempId=3498&grievDefined=0&serviceLinkRequired=No&userLoggedIn=N&source=CTZN&OWASP_CSRFTOKEN=SDI3-F0QL-JTG0-IVBU-CWVI-7UY4-IWJJ-1AGW\"]","confidence_score":100,"last_verified":"2026-07-14","manual_review_needed":0,"has_variants":0,"active":1,"version":5,"updated_by":"shivraj"},
